      "text": "The first-floor main entrance opens 7 a.m.–10 p.m. in term and 8 a.m.–10 p.m. in recess; weekend schedules are separate, holidays may differ, and on-site signage prevails. The third-floor rear entrance permits regular-hours passage, while the step-free main-entrance route is always available. After-hours entry requires eligibility and approved credentials. The information agent explains rules but cannot issue credentials, unlock doors, or verify locks."
